adi?"}],["$","$L28",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Dastlabki 2 soat — 1,5 baravarda, keyin — ikki baravarda. Dam olish/bayram kunlarida — ikki baravarda yoki qo'shimcha dam olish kuni."}]}]]}],["$","$L26","5",{"value":"faq-5","children":[["$","$L27",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"Ish haqi qanchalik tez-tez to'lanishi kerak?"}],["$","$L28",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Oyiga kamida ikki marta. Kechiktirganlik uchun — MB stavkasining (14%) 1/300 miqdorida har kunlik kompensatsiya."}]}]]}],["$","$L26","6",{"value":"faq-6","children":[["$","$L27",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"OTMda o'qiyotgan bo'lsam, ish beruvchi qo'shimcha imtiyoz beradimi?"}],["$","$L28",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"OTM (oliy ta'lim muassasasi) talabasi bo'lib ishlasangiz, qonun bo'yicha ish beruvchi sizga maxsus soliq imtiyozi bermaydi. Lekin yiliga 4,22 MIH gacha bo'lgan moddiy yordam JShShSdan ozod (5 739 200 so'm), o'qish to'lovi esa summa cheklovisiz JShShSdan ozod (SK 378-moddasi 16-bandi) — my.soliq.uz dagi deklaratsiyangiz orqali."}]}]]}],["$","$L26","7",{"value":"faq-7","children":[["$","$L27",null,{"className":"text-left text-foreground","children":"Qishloqda joylashgan ishxonada ish haqi shaharnikidan farq qiladimi?"}],["$","$L28",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":"Soliq stavkalari bir xil. Lekin minimal ish haqi Vazirlar Mahkamasi qarorlari bilan barcha hududlar uchun bir xil belgilanadi. Tarmoq tarif kelishuvlari ba'zi sohalarda farq qilishi mumkin."}]}]]}]]}]]}]
